layout: layouts/base.njk
pageCss: "members-respiracion.css"
title: "Respiración en Caja — Triaperformance All-Access"
---
{#- Box breathing. Its own page rather than the activation-tool template: that
    engine beeps, vibrates and counts down hard, which is correct for a warm-up
    and wrong for a wind-down. Everything here is the quiet version of the same
    decisions — silent by default, no vibration ever, no visible clock. -#}
<div class="bb" id="bb">

  <div class="crumb-bar">
    <a href="/members/#biblioteca">Biblioteca</a> / Respiración
  </div>

  <div class="bb-head">
    <span class="label">Respiración</span>
    <h1>Respiración en caja</h1>
    <p>Cuatro tiempos inhalando, cuatro sosteniendo, cuatro exhalando, cuatro sosteniendo. Sirve para bajar revoluciones: alarga la exhalación, sube el tono parasimpático y le avisa al sistema nervioso que la sesión terminó. Úsala cuando el cuerpo quedó acelerado y necesitas soltar.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="bb-setup" id="bbSetup">
    <div class="bb-q">¿Cuánto tiempo?</div>
    <div class="bb-mins">
      <button type="button" class="bb-min" data-min="3" aria-pressed="false">3 min</button>
      <button type="button" class="bb-min" data-min="5" aria-pressed="true">5 min</button>
      <button type="button" class="bb-min" data-min="10" aria-pressed="false">10 min</button>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="bb-btn" id="bbStart">Empezar</button>
    <div class="bb-sound">
      <button type="button" class="bb-ghost bb-sound-toggle" aria-pressed="false">Activar sonido suave</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bb-session" id="bbSession" hidden>
    <div class="bb-stage">
      <svg class="bb-svg" viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect class="bb-fill" id="bbFill" x="30" y="30" width="140" height="140" rx="10"/>
        <rect class="bb-track" x="30" y="30" width="140" height="140" rx="10"/>
        {#- Drawn as a path, not a rect, so the trace starts at the bottom-left
            corner and runs anticlockwise — the same direction the dot travels. -#}
        <path class="bb-trace" id="bbTrace" d="M30 170 L30 30 L170 30 L170 170 L30 170" pathLength="560"/>
        <circle class="bb-dot" id="bbDot" cx="30" cy="170" r="7"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="bb-readout">
        <div class="bb-phase" id="bbPhase">Inhala</div>
        <div class="bb-count" id="bbCount">4</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bb-progress-track"><div class="bb-progress" id="bbProgress"></div></div>
    <div class="bb-session-actions">
      <button type="button" class="bb-ghost bb-sound-toggle" aria-pressed="false">Activar sonido suave</button>
      <button type="button" class="bb-ghost bb-stop" id="bbStop">Terminar</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bb-done" id="bbDone" hidden>
    <h2>Listo</h2>
    <p>Quédate un momento antes de levantarte. Si te cuesta dormir después de una sesión fuerte, repítela en la cama con los ojos cerrados.</p>
    <button type="button" class="bb-ghost" id="bbAgain">Hacerlo de nuevo</button>
  </div>

</div>

<script id="bb-copy" type="application/json">{{ {
  "phases": ["Inhala", "Sostén", "Exhala", "Sostén"],
  "soundOn": "Sonido suave activado",
  "soundOff": "Activar sonido suave"
} | dump | safe }}</script>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/box-breathing.js' | v }}"></script>
